# ── Client Reviews Database (Upstash Redis) ───────────────────────────────
# Free account: https://upstash.com  → Create a Redis database → REST section
# In the deployment (Vercel) or in a local .env.local file, set these two:
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# NOTE: If these are empty the site STILL runs — reviews just fall back to a
# temporary in-memory store (they reset on server restart). Add the two values
# above to make client reviews permanent and shared across all visitors.
